  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1724329968_2269526_4bd83299ea99eb3822156f2dfb80ea1b.jpg",
  "description": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">A UK British made, sustainable gift business that celebrates the most important moments in people&rsquo;s lives while also being kind on the environment. Picture A Gift creates personalised prints that people would proudly hang in their homes for a lifetime, gifts that each time someone looks at feels loved and appreciated.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Dedicated to designing personalised, high-quality prints that capture the essence of life&rsquo;s most significant moments. We celebrate these events with names, occasions, special dates, and moments that hold a significant place in people&rsquo;s hearts. Whether it&rsquo;s a birthday celebration for a best friend, the first dance with a husband or wife, or a special date with a loved one, we create gifts that mark these milestones in a way that would be treasured forever.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Product Description<br></strong></span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">You can buy prints from A5, A4 and A3. You will also have the choice of buying quality UK handmade wooden gift frames with your personalised present. Finally, we offer the choice of gift wrapping which includes 5 colours of luxury ribbons and bows. The colours are are as follows: red, pink, gold, blue, white</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">The artwork is presented on luxurious 350gsm (super thick) silk card. Our card has been carefully selected by our product engineering team. The texture is smooth and elegant, while the weight is heavy, providing a sturdy composition that reflects the feeling of receiving a quality gift.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-4 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-module-4\" data-csa-c-id=\"1pfjfi-vpkobo-f3u0sm-cu6t3o\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-module-4\">\r\n<div class=\"aplus-module-wrapper apm-fixed-width\">\r\n<div class=\"apm-spacing\">\r\n<div class=\"apm-floatleft apm-fixed-width\">\r\n<div class=\"apm-spacing\">\r\n<table class=\"apm-fixed-width apm-fourthcol-table\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"apm-top\">\r\n<div class=\"apm-fourthcol\">\r\n<h4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">A5, A4 and A3 prints</span></h4>\r\n<p class=\"a-size-small\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Your artwork presented on luxurious A5 350gsm (super thick) silk card.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"a-size-small\"><span class=\"a-text-bold\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Print Sizes:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"a-size-small\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">A4: 148 x 210 mm, or 5.83 x 8.27 inches.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"a-size-small\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">A5: 210 x 297 mm, or 8.3 x 11.7 inches</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"a-size-small\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">A3: 297 x 420 mm, or 11.7 x 16.5 inches</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"apm-top\">\r\n<div class=\"apm-fourthcol\">\r\n<h4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Black or white wooden frames</span></h4>\r\n<p class=\"a-size-small\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">White and black frames can be purchased as an optional product enrichment when you click \"Customize Now\".</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"a-size-small\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Fully Wrapped MDF frame in a Matt White Finish 18mm wide</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"a-size-small\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Fitted with Non-Smash Perspex glass.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"apm-top\">\r\n<div class=\"apm-fourthcol\">\r\n<h4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">A5, A4, or A3 frame sizes</span></h4>\r\n<p class=\"a-size-small\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Quality wooden frames, manufactured in Britain.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"a-size-small\"><span class=\"a-text-bold\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Frame Sizes:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"a-size-small\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">A5: 235 x 175 mm, or 9.2 x 6.9 inches. A4: 325 x 240 mm, or 12.8 x 9.4 inches. A3: 450 x 330 mm, or 17.7 x 13 inches.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td class=\"apm-top\">\r\n<div class=\"apm-fourthcol\">\r\n<h4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Standing or hanging, portrait or landscape</span></h4>\r\n<p class=\"a-size-small\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Our frames are handmade in the United Kingdom and can be hung either portrait or landscape. They also have a stand, so you may put them on a coffee table freestanding or on a window shelf.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"a-size-small\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">The backs are made from MDF and are sturdy and reliable.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-6 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-module-6\" data-csa-c-id=\"wj54x3-5nuxcz-tm1gk9-m4v1b5\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-module-6\">\r\n<div class=\"aplus-module-wrapper apm-fixed-width\">\r\n<div class=\"aplus-module-content\" id=\"aplus-module-6-3\">\r\n<div class=\"apm-hovermodule\">\r\n<div class=\"apm-hovermodule-slides\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"></span></strong></div>\r\n<div class=\"apm-hovermodule-slides\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"></span></strong></div>\r\n<div class=\"apm-hovermodule-slides\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"></span></strong></div>\r\n<div class=\"apm-hovermodule-slides\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong></strong></span></div>\r\n<div class=\"apm-hovermodule-slides\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"apm-hovermodule-slides\"><br><strong>Unique Selling Point</strong><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Personalized, High-Quality Keepsakes</strong>: Every gift from Picture A Gift is meticulously crafted to be a unique, personalized keepsake that celebrates life's most significant moments. These aren't just gifts; they are cherished memories that people will proudly display in their homes for a lifetime.</span>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Sustainability Focus</strong>: Picture A Gift is committed to sustainability, using eco-friendly materials sourced from the UK. The company&rsquo;s dedication to minimizing environmental impact sets it apart in an industry often dominated by mass-produced, low-quality imports.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>British Craftsmanship</strong>: All gifts are made in the UK, emphasizing local craftsmanship and attention to detail. This ensures exceptional quality offering customers luxurious gifts that are both meaningful and responsibly made.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Emotional Connection</strong>: Picture A Gift stands out by focusing on the emotional significance behind each gift. The brand helps customers express their deepest sentiments, making each product not just a gift, but a lasting symbol of love, connection, and care.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Payment Terms<br></span></strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">You will recevie payment of 10% of the sale price one you make a sale.&nbsp;</span></p>",
